        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Minty Fresh!Although I think that Omnitron's second side brought back Interpolation Beam every single bloody time.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I always saw him bring back Repair Drones. &nbsp;I swear I killed that damn thing at least 10 times over the course of the game.</p>",
