      {
        "id": 163447,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-24T04:17:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabk\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabk/48/1978_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabk:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>mightyschoop wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Terra forming the red dust into a Tech singularity was a dirty trick. \"Here's your stuff back. Now Imma blow it all up.\" Bad robot! NO OILCAN FOR YOU!&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI was sneaky and tossed a foam grenade so I got the dust <em>after</em> the&nbsp;singularity. NIcely done, Bunker. NIcely done.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I had used Impromptu to get an Infrared Eyepiece, and had put the Tech Singularity at the bottom of the deck. The Terraforming blew up the Dust and got me my stuff back.</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
