      {
        "id": 163448,
        "name": "robb8888",
        "username": "robb8888",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-25T08:33:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Missed \"mint\" -- accidentally pressed the \"destroy this card\" power for Localized Hurricane. &nbsp; :( &nbsp;Ended up really getting whacked by Sedative Flechettes and Technological Singularity, Tempest was down to 1 HP...but then came Meteor Swarm. &nbsp;I literally turtled for about 6-7 rounds, using Cleansing Downpour and Maintenance Unit, building everybody's ongoings and equipment back, loading up the Omni-Cannon, then in a nice bit of coincidence, Omnitron pulled Terraforming just at the round I was ready to destroy Meteor Swarm myself. &nbsp;All four heroes opened up on him, and after Vicious Cyclone/Lightning Slash (+ Gene Bound Shackles), a super-powered Coolant Blast, a 30-point Omni Cannon burst, and a Inventory Barrage, the killer robot lay in pieces.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
