        "created_at": "2016-02-26T14:13:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was going through a test run last night in order to unlock the variants needed for this one-shot. It looks like Localized Hurricane is bugged. The \"First Power\" option is missing when you try and use the power from the zoomed in card view.</p>",
