        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-26T14:17:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Two things. &nbsp; First, you don't have to unlock any variants that are used in a one shot the game will let you use them even if you haven't met unlock conditions. &nbsp; I'm pretty sure this one shot was made so that new players who only have the base set could play with variants they have no ability to unlock currently. &nbsp; Second, I've seen that issue posted in various forums and threads so Handelabra is aware of that one. &nbsp;</p>",
