        "created_at": "2016-02-26T19:06:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Honestly, with this one, if you just keep using Infra Red Eyepiece as soon as you get it and keep the environment under control, you'll avoid his two worst cards entirely, and you shouldn't have any trouble from there.</p>",
