        "created_at": "2016-02-26T20:54:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The heroes were new to me, but it was the same old cards from the same old decks.&nbsp; Omnitron's a very familiar opponent and Wagner's a very familiar environment,&nbsp;so it's not too surprising that I got mint again.</p>",
