        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/cdc98d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-29T16:29:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I encountered a bug on this fight. I had played AZ’s card that causes villain effects that trigger at the end of the turn to trigger at the start instead (turned out to be a terrible idea), and Omni played a drone that triggers at the end of the turn. I forget which one, I’d have to check my Twitch highlight. Anyways, it still acted at the end of the turn instead of the beginning.</p>\n<p>If this was an “easy” one shot I’m glad it was the first one I tried - I admittedly played absolutely horribly, but I got my Mint.</p>",
